<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets warrants on two Jardine group companies.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on two Jardine group companies.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland Hong Kong Branch said on Friday it is issuing 350 million American-style call warrants on a basket of Jardine group of companies.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Hong Kong Land Holdings Ltd	  0.22 shares</p>
<p> Jardine Matheson Holdings Ltd	0.08 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    US$1.1817	PREMIUM	    12 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.2237	GEARING	    4.55X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	05.JUN.98	SETTLEMENT DATE  03.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     07.JUL.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE US$1.313	 MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
